<div class="container">
    <header class="cv-header">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Zvondis School Calendar Sync</p>
    </header>

    <section>
        <h2>What this app is</h2>
        <p>
            "Zvondis School Calendar Sync" is a personal utility built for the Semester page at
            <a href="https://zv0ndis.github.io/semester.html">zv0ndis.github.io/semester.html</a>. It
            keeps school-related events (semester dates, exam periods, calendar entries added on the
            site) in sync between that page and a Google Calendar belonging to the site owner, Tomáš
            Zvoníček. It is not a public product — it is used solely by the site owner's own Google
            account.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>What data is accessed</h2>
        <p>
            The app requests the <code>https://www.googleapis.com/auth/calendar</code> scope, which
            allows it to read, create, update, and delete events on the connected Google Calendar. No
            other Google data (email, contacts, files, etc.) is requested or accessed.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>How the data is used</h2>
        <p>
            Calendar events are read and written only to keep the website's semester/event data and
            the connected Google Calendar consistent with each other. Event data (dates and titles)
            is stored in the site's existing Firebase database and in the connected Google Calendar.
            No calendar data is sold, shared with third parties, or used for advertising.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>Data retention and revocation</h2>
        <p>
            Access can be revoked at any time from the
            <a href="https://myaccount.google.com/permissions" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
                >Google Account permissions page</a
            >. Revoking access immediately stops the sync from reading or writing calendar data.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
            Questions about this policy can be sent to
            <a href="mailto:zvondatom@gmail.com">zvondatom@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
    </section>
</div>
